        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-ink leading-tight mb-6">
          At the centre of therapy<br>there is <em class="text-primary not-italic">a relationship</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Methods matter. But the first condition for being able to work on anything is a relationship you trust. That's where our way of working starts.
